              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UElisha wayehlezi endlini yakhe labadala. Inkosi yasithuma umuntu; kodwa lesisithunywa singakafiki, uElisha wathi kwabadala: Liyabona ukuthi lowombulali uthumele isithunywa ukuba ngiqunywe ikhanda na? Khangelani, lapho isithunywa sifika, livale umnyango, libambe isivalo siqine. Kalizizwa izisinde zenkosi yakhe isilandela na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.32"
            ]
          }
        },
